<title>USA: MBIA lists secondary market insurance capacity.</title>
<headline>MBIA lists secondary market insurance capacity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it has limited remaining secondary market insurance capacity for the following credits:</p>
<p>--New York City Municipal Water Finance Authority revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Denver International Airport revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--MBTA and Massachusetts general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Arizona Public Service first mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>--Georgia Municipal Electric Authority (MEAG) power revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Washington Public Power Supply System Nuclear Projects 1, 2 and 3.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
